     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-tb-preventive-therapy-medication-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-tb-preventive-therapy-medication-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-tb-preventive-therapy-medication-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-tpt-isoniazid-100\">tpt-isoniazid-100</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Isoniazid 100 mg</td><td>Drug for TB preventive therapy. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-tpt-isoniazid-300\">tpt-isoniazid-300</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Isoniazid 300 mg</td><td>Drug for TB preventive therapy. The source form preprints once-daily frequency.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-tpt-isoniazid-rifapentine-3hp\">tpt-isoniazid-rifapentine-3hp</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Isoniazid/Rifapentine (3HP)</td><td>TB preventive therapy regimen listed on the source form; strength is entered separately.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs.html#ng-hiv-pharmacy-order-cs-tpt-other\">tpt-other</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Other TB preventive therapy drug or regimen</td><td>A TB preventive therapy drug or regimen not otherwise listed; specify separately.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
